  "strings": [
    "Aragorn, descendant of Isildur and King of all the Free Peoples\u0000",
    "was at last vanquished.\u0000",
    "Our last and greatest hope for victory was in the end thrown down\u0000",
    "by the same barbaric creatures who killed his father years before.\u0000",
    "Now the ranks of the Dark Lord swell as a rising tide of malice and hatred.\u0000",
    "And all shall be overwhelmed by that great, black wave.\u0000"
